  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The speaker is mapped onto the man in the foreground",
  "description": "The text 'see... i told you cyril.' implies that the man in the foreground is the speaker or is being referenced as the person who made the statement. The visual of the man laughing broadly is juxtaposed with the text to project the identity of the speaker onto him, making him the embodiment of the hateful statement. This is an analogical mapping where the textual entity 'cyril' (implied speaker) is mapped onto the visual entity 'man_in_foreground'.",
